# Cloudflare Workers static assets ignore list for the g4f.dev repository.
#
# g4f.dev is published as a static site by GitHub Pages, not as a Workers
# assets bundle. The Workers in workers/ are code-only API endpoints. If a
# Cloudflare build or a manual `wrangler deploy --assets .` treats this
# repository as an assets directory, the VCS pack (>100 MiB) and the ffmpeg
# WASM builds (>25 MiB each) otherwise fail with:
#
#   ✘ [ERROR] Asset too large.
#
# Ignore everything so Worker deployments upload only the Worker script.
# Remove the leading `*` and narrow this list if you ever intentionally want
# to serve repository files as Workers static assets.
*
